('seo','Search Engine Optimization','Be found. For the right reasons.','Search visibility is only useful when it brings the right buyers. We connect technical foundations, useful content and commercial intent.','technical SEO|on-page optimization|content strategy|link earning|local SEO|SEO for SaaS','Search Console · Screaming Frog · GA4','Qualified organic leads · non-brand clicks · indexed priority pages'),
('paid-media','Paid Media','Make every click accountable.','Bring acquisition spend closer to revenue. We build campaigns around intent, reliable measurement and a clear testing plan.','Google Search and Performance Max|Display and YouTube|Microsoft Ads|LinkedIn Ads|conversion tracking|landing-page CRO','Google Ads · Microsoft Ads · LinkedIn Campaign Manager · GTM','Qualified pipeline · cost per qualified lead · conversion rate'),
